    narr:narration """This hub tracks the evolution of the [core product differentiator](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), which centers on capturing decision artifacts at the moment of consensus. While the foundational mission was established in March 2026, the narrative trajectory shifted by late August 2026 toward operational validation. This recent phase is marked by [team-level reporting](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787835375249_1) confirming the shipment of the async decision widget, supported by [quantitative performance metrics](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787835375249_2) and the identification of the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787835375249_3) as a critical technical unlock. Alongside these delivery claims, a [meta-inquiry](narr:Position_Sprint4DeliveryClaims) persists, questioning the internal mechanics of how the team defines, measures, and attributes success to specific product features.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787835375249_1> ;
